{"seq":3,"slug":"saga-patterns","title":"Saga 与最终一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-transactions-concurrency/distributed/saga-patterns","wordCount":1464,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"saga-与最终一致性\">Saga 与最终一致性</h1><p><a href=\"two-phase-commit\">两阶段提交与共识</a>能让跨节点提交保持原子，但它有两个在微服务世界里难以下咽的代价：参与者在准备阶段要持锁等裁决，长流程下数据被冻结太久；而且它要求所有参与方都支持 2PC 协议，可一个跨订单、库存、支付、物流四个独立服务的下单流程里，支付走的是第三方网关，根本不可能加入你的 2PC。当强一致的门槛高到业务无法承受，Saga 提供了另一种思路：放弃跨服务的原子性，把长事务拆成一串各自提交的本地事务，出错就用补偿操作反向纠正，以最终一致性换取可用性与解耦。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Saga 把一个长事务拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1, T_2, \\dots, T_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一串本地事务，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在自己的服务里独立提交。为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 配一个补偿事务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用来在语义上抵消 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的效果。若执行到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 失败，就按逆序执行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{k-1}, \\dots, C_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 回滚已完成的步骤。它不保证任意时刻的强一致，只保证流程要么全部成功、要么被补偿到一个语义一致的终态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  T1[T1 创建订单] --&gt;|成功| T2[T2 扣减库存]&#10;  T2 --&gt;|成功| T3[T3 扣款]&#10;  T3 --&gt;|失败| C2[C2 恢复库存]&#10;  C2 --&gt; C1[C1 取消订单]&#10;  T3 -.成功则.-&gt; T4[T4 发起配送]&#10;  C1 --&gt; END[补偿完成,回到一致终态]\">graph TD\n  T1[T1 创建订单] --&gt;|成功| T2[T2 扣减库存]\n  T2 --&gt;|成功| T3[T3 扣款]\n  T3 --&gt;|失败| C2[C2 恢复库存]\n  C2 --&gt; C1[C1 取消订单]\n  T3 -.成功则.-&gt; T4[T4 发起配送]\n  C1 --&gt; END[补偿完成,回到一致终态]</pre><p>下表把 Saga 与分布式事务（2PC）放在一起对比，凸显它「以一致性换可用性」的取舍。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>分布式事务（2PC）</th>\n<th>Saga</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原子性</td>\n<td>强原子，全有全无</td>\n<td>无，靠补偿达成语义一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离性</td>\n<td>有（持锁到提交）</td>\n<td>无，中间状态对外可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持锁时长</td>\n<td>整个事务期间</td>\n<td>仅单步本地事务期间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性模型</td>\n<td>强一致</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>短事务、可控参与方</td>\n<td>长流程、跨异构服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"补偿不是回滚-语义抵消的难处\">补偿不是回滚：语义抵消的难处</h2><p>Saga 最容易被误解的地方是把补偿当成数据库回滚。回滚是物理地还原旧值、且发生在数据对外可见之前；而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一旦提交，它的效果已经对外可见、可能已被别的流程读到甚至据此行动了。所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只能做「语义上的抵消」——比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是「扣款」，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是「假装没扣过」，而是「发起一笔退款」，账面上会留下扣款与退款两条记录。</p>\n<p>这带来三个棘手要求。其一，补偿必须可交换/幂等：网络重试可能让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 执行多次，多扣一次库存就错了。其二，有些操作根本不可补偿——邮件已经发出去就收不回，这类步骤要尽量排到 Saga 末尾。其三，缺乏隔离性：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 提交后、流程尚未走完时，别的事务可能读到这个「中间态」并据此决策。每个本地事务内部仍由前几章的机制（<a href=\"../concurrency-control/two-phase-locking\">2PL</a> 或 <a href=\"../concurrency-control/mvcc\">MVCC</a>）保证本地隔离，但跨步骤的全局隔离 Saga 不提供。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编排式-vs-编舞式-谁来推动流程\">编排式 vs 编舞式：谁来推动流程</h2><p>Saga 的执行有两种组织方式，区别在于「谁知道整个流程的全貌」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  ORCH[编排式 Orchestration] --&gt; CO[中央协调器]&#10;  CO --&gt;|命令| S1[订单服务]&#10;  CO --&gt;|命令| S2[库存服务]&#10;  CO --&gt;|命令| S3[支付服务]&#10;  CO --&gt;|失败时下达补偿命令| S2&#10;  CHOR[编舞式 Choreography] --&gt; E1[订单服务发事件]&#10;  E1 --&gt;|监听| E2[库存服务发事件]&#10;  E2 --&gt;|监听| E3[支付服务]&#10;  E3 --&gt;|失败发补偿事件| E2\">flowchart TD\n  ORCH[编排式 Orchestration] --&gt; CO[中央协调器]\n  CO --&gt;|命令| S1[订单服务]\n  CO --&gt;|命令| S2[库存服务]\n  CO --&gt;|命令| S3[支付服务]\n  CO --&gt;|失败时下达补偿命令| S2\n  CHOR[编舞式 Choreography] --&gt; E1[订单服务发事件]\n  E1 --&gt;|监听| E2[库存服务发事件]\n  E2 --&gt;|监听| E3[支付服务]\n  E3 --&gt;|失败发补偿事件| E2</pre><p>编排式由一个中央协调器（如基于状态机的 orchestrator）显式地按步骤下命令、收结果、决定下一步或触发补偿。它流程清晰、易于监控与调试，但协调器是逻辑中心，要小心别让它变成单点或上帝对象。编舞式则没有中心，每个服务完成自己的本地事务后发布一个事件，下游服务监听事件自行触发——耦合最松、最去中心，但流程散落在各服务里，全局视图难以追踪、循环依赖难以发现。一般跨团队的复杂业务倾向编排式，简单链路可用编舞式。协调器自身的状态推进也要持久化（用<a href=\"../recovery-durability/write-ahead-logging\">预写日志 WAL</a> 式的事件日志），以便它崩溃重启后从断点续推。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cap-base-与最终一致性的版图\">CAP、BASE 与最终一致性的版图</h2><p>Saga 是「在分布式系统里主动选择 AP 而非 CP」的典型落地。CAP 定理说在网络分区发生时，强一致（C）与可用性（A）只能取一个。2PC 这类强一致方案选 C：分区时宁可阻塞也不返回可能不一致的结果。Saga 选 A：分区时各服务继续可用、各做各的本地事务，事后用补偿和最终一致性收敛。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>Saga 的立场</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CAP 中的 C</td>\n<td>任何读都看到最新写</td>\n<td>放弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CAP 中的 A</td>\n<td>每个请求都得到响应</td>\n<td>优先保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BASE</td>\n<td>基本可用、软状态、最终一致</td>\n<td>正是 Saga 的一致性模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>停止写入后系统终将收敛到一致</td>\n<td>Saga 的终态保证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>与 ACID 严丝合缝的强保证相对，BASE（Basically Available, Soft state, Eventually consistent）描述了 Saga 这类系统的松弛保证：允许中间态、允许短暂不一致，但承诺最终收敛。这正是<a href=\"../foundations/acid-transactions\">事务与 ACID</a>所定义的强保证在分布式压力下被有意识放松后的样子——从 ACID 到 BASE，是这一整章「为可用性逐步松动一致性」主线的终点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Saga 把长事务拆成一串各自提交的本地事务，出错按逆序执行补偿，以最终一致换取可用性与解耦。</li>\n<li>补偿是语义抵消而非物理回滚，须幂等、注意不可补偿步骤后置、且缺乏跨步骤的全局隔离。</li>\n<li>编排式用中央协调器流程清晰易监控，编舞式用事件驱动最去中心但难追踪，按复杂度选型。</li>\n<li>Saga 是在 CAP 里主动选 A 弃 C 的落地，其一致性模型是 BASE 与最终一致。</li>\n<li>从 <a href=\"../foundations/acid-transactions\">ACID</a> 的强保证到 Saga 的 BASE，正是本章「为可用性逐步松动一致性」的终点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Saga 与最终一致性","id":"saga-与最终一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"补偿不是回滚：语义抵消的难处","id":"补偿不是回滚-语义抵消的难处"},{"level":2,"text":"编排式 vs 编舞式：谁来推动流程","id":"编排式-vs-编舞式-谁来推动流程"},{"level":2,"text":"CAP、BASE 与最终一致性的版图","id":"cap-base-与最终一致性的版图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式快照隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-transactions-concurrency/distributed/distributed-isolation"},"next":null}